      "intended_behavior": "Implement the ExecuteToolStage similar to the TS version. It wraps the execution of a single tool and supports short-circuiting (returning mock results without executing the tool). It accepts context including agent, tool, toolUse, invocationState, and extends or utilizes a MiddlewareInterruptible base to support interrupt path. Hooks BeforeToolCallEvent and AfterToolCallEvent run outside the middleware, even on short-circuit."
